d<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Batch Post-processing Error Notification</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f7f7f7;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      color: #333;
    }
    .container {
      background: #ffffff;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      padding: 25px 30px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid #dedede;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #c62828;
      margin-top: 0;
    }
    .section {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .label {
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #222;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #777;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .highlight {
      background-color: #fbe9e7;
      padding: 10px;
      border-left: 4px solid #d84315;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-family: Consolas, Courier, monospace;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
  <h2>Batch Post-processing Error Notification</h2>

  <p>
    An error occurred during the scheduled job after batch processing for the transaction referenced below.
  </p>

  <div class="section">
    <p><span class="label">Transaction ID:</span><br>
      #[output application/java --- vars.notification.content.transactionId]
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p><span class="label">Error Type:</span><br>
      #[output application/java --- vars.notification.content.errorType]
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <p><span class="label">Error Description:</span></p>
    <div class="highlight">
      #[output application/java --- vars.notification.content.errorMessage]
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>
    Please review the error details and take the appropriate remediation steps.
    If this issue persists, contact the integration support team.
  </p>

  <div class="footer">
    This is an automated notification—please do not reply to this email.
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>